      "tex_lines": {
        "511": "Define, for the residue classes $r\\equiv d\\bmod 2f$, ",
        "512": "fixing the additional notation",
        "513": "$d=r+h\\cdot (2f)$, and choosing representatives $1\\leq r\\leq 2f$,",
        "517": "\\item[] For $f\\geq 5$",
        "526": "\\item[(d)] $\\KK_{f}(h,f)=(4f+1)\\cdot h+(5f-3)$;",
        "561": "\\item[(k)] Finally, for small values of $d$ (that is, of $h$ and $r$),",
        "562": "the following corrections are to be made to $\\KK_{r}$ for",
        "563": "$f\\geq 5$:",
        "565": "\\item[(k$_0$)] if $h=0$, subtract $2f+r$ from $\\KK_{r}$;",
        "708": "\\begin{conjecture}\\label{conj:pre}",
        "709": "For all $f, d=g-f\\geq 1$ the strict, greedy 2-sum sequence",
        "710": "$S_{f,g}$ is ultimately periodic with preperiod length",
        "711": "\t$\\QQ(d,f)=\\KK_{r}(d,f)$, where $r\\equiv d\\bmod 2f$."
